{"Title":"Order relative to authorizing the joint committee on Election Laws to make an investigation and study of a certain current Senate document relative to extending voting rights in municipal elections to noncitizen voters.","BillNumber":"S2654","DocketNumber":null,"GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"J15","Name":"Joint Committee on Election Laws","Type":2,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J15","ResponseDate":"2024-02-07T16:01:41.04"},"Cosponsors":[],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S2654/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Order","Pinslip":"Senate, February 15, 2024 -- The committee on Election Laws, to whom was referred the petition (accompanied by bill, Senate, No. 415) of James B. Eldridge for legislation to extend voting rights in municipal elections to noncitizen voters of the commonwealth, report the accompanying Order  (Senate, No. 2654).","DocumentText":"\tOrdered, That the committee on Election Laws be authorized and directed to make an investigation and study of certain current Senate document numbered 415 relative to extending voting rights in municipal elections to noncitizen voters.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Study","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J15","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J15"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Discharge to Another Committee","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J40","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J40"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}